# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the
# committing editor/OS's own settings or core.autocrlf. Without this, a
# CRLF-saving editor on Windows produces diffs that touch every line of a
# file instead of the real change (see git history 17 Aug 2026).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.step binary
*.stl binary
*.stp binary
*.f3z binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
